    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gist</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis is casual Japanese FPS horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIncluding little bit of jump scare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNo technical actions needed, so you can play it totally chill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe language is available in Japanese and English, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000but you cannot change it during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAuto-save. You can start over from the game over point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlay time is about 1 hour at the earliest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe difficulty level cannot be selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About this game</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that aims to communicate with the existence of terrifying urban legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and find clues to advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you come across her somewhere in the house, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >observe her carefully to know what she wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give her what she wants and she won't harm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is a time limit. You can't take your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to give her everything she wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A modern urban legend from a certain region</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let it in . . . . Your entire existence will be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's such a horrifying urban legend in this region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736030/extras/cbc2214ec644cf4281753974ac29f34e.avif?t=1751898907\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736030/extras/27eacfb7b4961269d171ffa99b2c13c9.avif?t=1751898907\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Urban Legends That Won't Go Away</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily you were not erased, but it won't go anywhere either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no dawn, you start living with fear. literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736030/extras/537ebf223dd552c9855e71c5def692e5.avif?t=1751898907\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Tense communal living</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's out there somewhere. Please look for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What it wants and what it wants to do. You guess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736030/extras/5fa6a6fab26a8fac8825b76a891bcdd3.avif?t=1751898907\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Horrifying Ending</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is multi ending. Hold on to see both ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
